WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.250
What happens when 800 of the world’s most elite footballers

00:00:03.250 --> 00:00:05.666
and their managers live together under one roof?

00:00:05.666 --> 00:00:05.750
Players stop being polite

00:00:05.750 --> 00:00:07.458
Players stop being polite

00:00:07.458 --> 00:00:09.583
and start getting Real.

00:00:09.583 --> 00:00:10.208
This is

00:00:10.208 --> 00:00:11.625
The Champions

00:00:11.625 --> 00:00:13.208
Despite recent results,

00:00:13.208 --> 00:00:16.208
we already got the historic quadruple this season. 

00:00:16.208 --> 00:00:17.416
We were investigated by

00:00:17.416 --> 00:00:20.416
UEFA, FIFA, the FA and the Premier League!

00:00:20.416 --> 00:00:23.166
I followed in the footsteps of the greats...

00:00:23.166 --> 00:00:24.416
by leaving Southampton!

00:00:24.416 --> 00:00:26.041
You think Icardi's a dog?

00:00:26.041 --> 00:00:27.583
I shagged me brother's missus. 

00:00:27.583 --> 00:00:29.000
-Alright, and that's all we need.

00:00:29.000 --> 00:00:30.500
Thank you for coming in, Mr. Giggs. 

00:00:36.625 --> 00:00:37.791
Send message:

00:00:37.791 --> 00:00:41.208
Hello, lads! Meet me in the backyard for a smashing good time.

00:00:44.250 --> 00:00:46.250
Why did Harry Kane text us to...

00:00:46.250 --> 00:00:49.958
cheese him in the backyard for a crashing wood crime?

00:00:51.333 --> 00:00:53.291
Nothing to be scared of, Phil, it's just a tent. 

00:00:53.291 --> 00:00:55.666
Oh, I'm not scared. This is my happy face.

00:00:55.666 --> 00:00:58.416
Gentlemen, welcome to Tentingham!

00:01:02.250 --> 00:01:03.541
Oo wunderbar.

00:01:03.541 --> 00:01:05.458
This must have taken you all weekend.

00:01:05.458 --> 00:01:07.583
Yeah...all weekend...

00:01:09.375 --> 00:01:10.208
Come in, come in.

00:01:10.208 --> 00:01:12.416
I thought we'd have a casual day baking.

00:01:12.416 --> 00:01:13.083
It's so new.

00:01:13.083 --> 00:01:13.875
Oh my dog. 

00:01:13.875 --> 00:01:14.666
It looks like a toilet seat.

00:01:14.666 --> 00:01:17.333
Hello. Remember me? I'm Arsene.

00:01:17.333 --> 00:01:19.041
And I am the Special One.

00:01:19.041 --> 00:01:23.833
Welcome to the Great British Baking Derby!

00:01:25.416 --> 00:01:27.750
While we're all optimistic, when it comes to a big game,

00:01:27.750 --> 00:01:30.500
Spurs have a tendency to be rather...

00:01:30.500 --> 00:01:31.125
-Spursy?

00:01:31.125 --> 00:01:31.625
That's the word!

00:01:31.625 --> 00:01:33.666
So I asked myself, "If I were British

00:01:33.666 --> 00:01:35.750
and wanted to a win a trophy, what would I do?"

00:01:35.750 --> 00:01:37.708
So I organized a baking competition!

00:01:37.708 --> 00:01:39.375
Now, every competition needs judges,

00:01:39.375 --> 00:01:41.041
so I found the most judgmental

00:01:41.041 --> 00:01:42.958
and also out-of-work people that I know.

00:01:42.958 --> 00:01:44.416
And to ensure that we win,

00:01:44.416 --> 00:01:46.958
I've had the boys practicing baking for weeks now.

00:01:46.958 --> 00:01:48.791
Hopefully this works. And we should win,

00:01:48.791 --> 00:01:50.041
because after all,

00:01:50.041 --> 00:01:51.833
we are the only team ready for this.

00:01:51.833 --> 00:01:53.625
F--k yeah, we are ready for this!

00:01:55.875 --> 00:01:58.208
Whoa. You guys have more resources than I do?

00:01:58.208 --> 00:01:59.625
Oh no.

00:02:00.750 --> 00:02:02.958
Liverpool's pies have somehow been impressive all season,

00:02:02.958 --> 00:02:05.166
but something tells me they will slip up in the final.

00:02:05.166 --> 00:02:07.833
Just a fun day out, he said. No stress, he said.

00:02:07.833 --> 00:02:11.000
All of a sudden I'm under a lot of pressure to score...

00:02:11.000 --> 00:02:13.250
ALL THESE PIES!

00:02:15.458 --> 00:02:17.083
Come on, we need to go higher.

00:02:17.083 --> 00:02:20.250
Uh, I fear we may have reached our ceiling.

00:02:20.250 --> 00:02:22.208
Tottenham are making a Tottenham cake

00:02:22.208 --> 00:02:25.875
which is pink and fun, but also crumbly and fragile.

00:02:25.875 --> 00:02:27.916
I'll put the proof in the pudding.

00:02:27.916 --> 00:02:31.208
Ow! My ankle. Now I've got soggy bottoms.

00:02:31.208 --> 00:02:32.125
Oh no.

00:02:32.125 --> 00:02:35.500
Man City will be making a perfect Manchester tart.

00:02:35.500 --> 00:02:37.208
For the literal cherry on top,

00:02:37.208 --> 00:02:39.166
I'm having the finest Maraschino cherries

00:02:39.166 --> 00:02:40.958
flown here on a private jet.

00:02:40.958 --> 00:02:43.416
We are just so happy to have you on our team.

00:02:43.416 --> 00:02:45.583
For their signature bake, Manchester United are making...

00:02:45.583 --> 00:02:46.916
a huge mistake.

00:02:46.916 --> 00:02:49.541
Seriously, they think this garden gnome of a manager is better than me?

00:02:49.541 --> 00:02:51.666
Ah! You got me! Haha!

00:02:51.666 --> 00:02:53.250
Oh, this is fun, isn't it.

00:02:55.791 --> 00:02:58.333
To be honest, I really thought when we hosted this competition

00:02:58.333 --> 00:03:01.250
that the other clubs, they had, like, little to no baking experience,

00:03:01.250 --> 00:03:05.166
but as it turns out they are taking this very seriously, so...

00:03:05.166 --> 00:03:07.208
Guys, you need to focus on the finish.

00:03:07.208 --> 00:03:11.958
Aguero, get the decorative Lancashire roses. 9320 of them!

00:03:11.958 --> 00:03:13.875
Come on, put more pressure on it, Mo.

00:03:16.625 --> 00:03:18.875
These all appear to be top, top quality.

00:03:18.875 --> 00:03:20.583
Voyeur. I won't taste them,

00:03:20.583 --> 00:03:21.750
because I know they are not as good

00:03:21.750 --> 00:03:23.458
as the Chelsea buns I made—three times.

00:03:23.458 --> 00:03:26.125
In fourth and last place. You. You. You.

00:03:26.125 --> 00:03:27.875
And especially you, Paul.

00:03:27.875 --> 00:03:29.458
You should all be disappointed.

00:03:29.458 --> 00:03:31.458
Fourth place is nice. Take it from me.

00:03:31.458 --> 00:03:33.208
It is the same as a trophy.

00:03:33.208 --> 00:03:35.791
Okay, but come on, Harry's ankle has been through so much...

00:03:35.791 --> 00:03:38.333
He deserves something for his baking contributions.

00:03:38.333 --> 00:03:39.625
Okay. Fine, whatever.

00:03:39.625 --> 00:03:41.708
Harry Kane, you are hereby a Member of the

00:03:41.708 --> 00:03:43.875
Most Excellent Order of the Baking Empire.

00:03:45.583 --> 00:03:47.875
Hey! Harry's been awarded MBE!

00:03:55.166 --> 00:03:57.000
Alright, Harry. Yeah!

00:03:59.541 --> 00:04:02.583
So, how do we beat Liverpool on the pitch?

